{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naughty Laundry\u00a0</i>is an adult management simulation game with visual novel-like elements. This game is a full redo of the initial Naughty Laundry prototype, redoing the gameplay, art style, and overall aspect of the game. But same as before, you're a mysterious laundry shop owner who does some strange and naughty stuff to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do mind that you\u00a0and your washing machines are not normal at all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naughty Laundry [Redux]\u00a0</i>\u00a0is a quirky simulation game where you run a seemingly ordinary laundry shop on the outskirts of town. Your job? Wash clothes, satisfy your customers, and keep the machines humming. But beneath the bubbles and steam, something strange is going on. Because these machines don\u2019t just clean clothes\u2014they reveal secrets, awaken desires, and sometimes... transform customers into something else entirely. Manage your shop, uncover bizarre stories, and decide how deep you want to dive into the sudsy, seductive mystery of Naughty Laundry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/669300fa37a722012e91e5cfe5edb214.poster.avif?t=1758522663\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/669300fa37a722012e91e5cfe5edb214.webm?t=1758522663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/669300fa37a722012e91e5cfe5edb214.mp4?t=1758522663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current gameplay loop includes interacting with different characters as they go to your mysterious laundry shop. Your job is to interact with and entertain these characters. However, you're free to experiment however you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/768733f06b0de24591329b2ee57b5e49.poster.avif?t=1758522663\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/768733f06b0de24591329b2ee57b5e49.webm?t=1758522663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/extras/768733f06b0de24591329b2ee57b5e49.mp4?t=1758522663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713030?t=1758522663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713030?t=1758522663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/2fcf3909db2d85a18c45efad3100f443a9d83880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758522663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713030/2fcf3909db2d85a18c45efad3100f443a9d83880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758522663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game features sexual acts involving human and monster human characters, including suggestive non-consensual sex."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naughty Laundry\u00a0</i>is an adult management simulation game with visual novel-like elements. This game is a full redo of the initial Naughty Laundry prototype, redoing the gameplay, art style, and overall aspect of the game. But same as before, you're a mysterious laundry shop owner who does some strange and naughty stuff to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do mind that you\u00a0a